<style>
.root { gap: 28px; }
.flowstrip { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
.card.code .d { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--code); }
.card.code { background: var(--elevated); }
.cardlogo { height: 24px; opacity: 0.85; margin-left: 12px; }
</style>
<style>@page { size: 900,00pt 600,00pt; margin: 0 }</style></head>
<body>
<h1>The agent firewall stack: four layers, four questions</h1>

<div class="col root"><div class="row" style="align-items:center"><div class="card blue"><div class="t">LAYER 1 · INGRESS IDENTITY</div><div class="d">strip client claims unconditionally · resolve server-side · re-stamp from the verified row</div>
<div class="d">per-agent credentials · token exchange (RFC 8693) · workload identity (SPIFFE SVIDs)</div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:var(--blue)">WHO</div></div></div>
<div class="arrow">↓</div>
<div class="row" style="align-items:center"><div class="card green"><div class="t">LAYER 2 · TOOL-CALL POLICY</div><div class="d">deterministic allow / ask / deny · fail-closed · policy-as-code, never a model call</div>
<div class="d">OPA Rego · Cedar · YAML first-match · glob + argument rules · rate limits · kill switch</div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:var(--green)">WHAT</div></div></div>
<div class="arrow">↓</div>
<div class="row" style="align-items:center"><div class="card"><div class="t">LAYER 3 · EGRESS &amp; DATA</div><div class="d">default-deny network paths · taint tracking (credential read poisons the session) · response DLP</div>
<div class="d">kernel netfilter · redact secrets before the model sees them · RFC1918 + metadata blocks</div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink2)">WHERE</div></div></div>
<div class="arrow">↓</div>
<div class="row" style="align-items:center"><div class="card"><div class="t">LAYER 4 · AUDIT &amp; RECEIPTS</div><div class="d">ground truth recorded outside the model · tamper-evident · replayable</div>
<div class="d">HMAC-signed JSONL · mediator-signed action receipts · full execution trail for replay</div></div>
<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink2)">WHEN</div></div></div></div>


</body>
</html>
